  "name": "E17. Above-average filter",
  "rawText": "# Question: Which products earn more revenue than the average product?\n# Answer: A scalar context aggregate (AVG) used as a filter.\nProductSales is OrderItems: ProductId,\n    SUM(Quantity * UnitPrice).Round(2) TotalRevenue\nProducts:\n  Inner Join ProductSales On Id = ProductSales.ProductId\n  Select Id,\n    Name,\n    ProductSales.TotalRevenue TotalRevenue\n  Where ProductSales.TotalRevenue \u003E AVG(ProductSales.TotalRevenue)\n  Order TotalRevenue DESC\n  Take 10",
